@startuml cu05
!theme plain
title CU05 — Preparar escritura

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) looks up a deed management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the list of available managements.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the management data and asks to prepare the deed.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) confirms the preparation.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the deed preparation.
System -> System : System

@enduml